12. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 4 of 2023 concerning Acting Governor, Acting Regent, and Acting Mayor (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2023 Number 310);
13. Decree of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 100.2.1.3-6572 of 2023 concerning Appointment of Acting Mayor of Cirebon Province of West Java;
14. Regional Regulation of Cirebon City Number 9 of 2016 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products (Regional Gazette of Cirebon City of 2016 Number 9), as amended by Regional Regulation of Cirebon City Number 5 of 2020 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation Number 9 of 2016 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products (Regional Gazette of Cirebon City of 2020 Number 5);
